  message: "Merged as PR #2255 (dev c2f3a6694). EVIDENCE (production path): after a bare smart-test run folded the index, ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/bar/recheck_kazud.py replants both campaign-3 faults and asks select_by_statement: '_read_framework_patterns assign None missed before 11, kept now 11, still out []'; 'get_language negate if missed before 1, kept now 1, still out []'; CLEAN (recheck_kazud.txt). go-unexported's recorded blocks went 27 -> 2,452. Guard: check-kept-work flagged exactly test_axiom_falsification.py::survey.<locals>.run before the mark and is clean after; test_kept_work_guard.py pins the closure shape (module/session/dynamic scope, nonlocal, nested) and its non-shapes (function scope, bare fixture, plain helper, rebinding). tests/test_kept_work_contexts.py: a module-fixture closure in the toy project; both tests carry the cache and are paired with what the fill ran. The same PR fixed the two red scheduled steps at 53301132 (both mine): test-agent-infra (the toy project's child lacked hypergumbo_core's path) and self-tree-validation (shared_context had lost its production caller in 0ec2953c4)."  # f65c
